2085 0 obj
<<
/Title (Move to Hold if the share price approaches the target so that the remaining upside is small, or if revised earnings expectations and valuation assumptions imply materially less upside. Become more cautious on \(a\) a renewed rise in NPLs or impairment charges; \(b\) slower NII growth as lower funding costs give less support; \(c\) weaker regional subsidiary performance, currency losses or political disruption; or \(d\) sustainable ROE below the 22% base case, or a higher required return that lowers justified P/B.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1183 0 R
>>
endobj
