/Title (Call. Equity Group is rated Buy, with a price target of KES 101.97, 48% above the KES 69.00 close on 31 March 2026. The target is a justified price-to-book multiple of 1.24x on FY25 book value of KES 82.02, built from a normalised ROE of 22%, a cost of equity of 18.9% and long-run growth of 6%.)
