/Title (Equity Group Holdings is a Nairobi-listed financial services group built around Equity Bank. It began as a building society in 1984, became a commercial bank and listed on the Nairobi Securities Exchange in 2006. Today it runs banking subsidiaries across Kenya, Uganda, Tanzania, Rwanda, South Sudan and the Democratic Republic of Congo, alongside payments and fintech, insurance, investment banking and foundation activities. It serves mass-market, small-business and agricultural customers, mostly through digital channels.)
